<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Saflife cautions on JCI/Lonrho talks.</title>
<headline>Saflife cautions on JCI/Lonrho talks.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saflife Ltd on Tuesday urged shareholders to exercise caution in their share dealings in view of talks between JCI Ltd and Lonrho Plc on a possible merger.</p>
<p>Saflife financed black empowerment consortium African Mining Group's takeover of JCI.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482-1003</p>
